<title>AUSTRALIA: SFE wheat in sideways drift.</title>
<headline>SFE wheat in sideways drift.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange wheat futures drifted sideways on Thursday with market leader January 1998 the only contract to trade.</p>
<p>January slipped by 50 cents to A$172.50 on the traded price compared with Wednesday's closing settlement price. Other settlement prices showed a mixed pattern with variations of about A$1.00 a tonne.</p>
